==Information==
===Format===
*'''Regular Season - Swiss Stage:''' ''March 21<sup>st</sup> - 29<sup>th</sup>''
**Swiss with 4 rounds
**All matches are {{Ft|3}}
**{{Bgcolortext|up|Top 6 teams}} advance to '''Regular Season - Round Robin:'''
***4 teams that reach 2 wins advance.
***Teams of 1-2 result will battle against with teams of 0-2 result, winners advance.
*'''Regular Season - Round Robin Stage:''' ''April 4<sup>th</sup> - 19<sup>th</sup>''
**Round Robin
**All matches are {{Ft|3}}
**{{Bgcolortext|up|Top 4 teams}} advance to '''Regional Playoffs'''
*'''Regional Playoffs:''' ''April 25<sup>th</sup> - 26<sup>th</sup>''
**Double elimination bracket
**All matches ''(excl. Grand Finals)'' are {{Ft|3}}
**Grand Finals are {{Ft|4}}
*'''Hero Bans'''
**Each team bans 1 hero per map, with the ban impacting both teams
**Each ban must be from a different role than the other team's ban
**Teams can only ban a hero once per series, but may repeat a ban from the opposing team
**The higher seeded team or team that has lost the last map chooses to ban first or second

